Package: libgtk-3-0t64
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: adwaita-icon-theme,
         hicolor-icon-theme,
         libgtk-3-common (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
         shared-mime-info,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: ibus-gtk3,
            libgtk-3-bin,
            librsvg2-common
Suggests: gvfs
Breaks: libgtk-layer-shell0 (<< 0.9.0)
Provides: ${gtk:BinVer}
Description: GTK graphical user interface library
 GTK is a multi-platform toolkit for creating graphical user
 interfaces. Offering a complete set of widgets, GTK is suitable
 for projects ranging from small one-off tools to complete application
 suites.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries.
 .
 This build has no X11 support: only the Wayland backend of GDK is
 compiled in. See /usr/share/doc/libgtk-3-0t64/README.md of the crick
 Debian backports repository for the consequences.

